 "description": "<DIV STYLE=\"text-align:Left;\"><DIV><DIV><P><SPAN>Site address points represent the location of site or service delivery addresses assigned by local governments. Used to standardize addresses across city departments. Uses ESRI Local Government Information schema, and is projected in Louisiana State Plane. Updated weekly based on changes made by Safety and Permits.</SPAN></P></DIV></DIV></DIV>",
